      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322062Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The problem io_uring solves",
      "source_hash": 4875697019133191638,
      "context_hash": 3078976481984396799,
      "translation": "io_uring이 해결하는 문제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322062Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Traditional I/O interfaces:",
      "source_hash": 8055780266014738929,
      "context_hash": 13261289897611585902,
      "translation": "전통적인 I/O 인터페이스:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322062Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`read()`/`write()`: one syscall per operation, blocking",
      "source_hash": 6033714189750241671,
      "context_hash": 12622425241422696506,
      "translation": "`read()`/`write()`: 연산당 시스템 콜 한 번, 블로킹",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322062Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`aio_read()` (POSIX AIO): thread-pool based, complex API, poor performance",
      "source_hash": 279019537996768297,
      "context_hash": 10410171417531411263,
      "translation": "`aio_read()` (POSIX AIO): 스레드 풀 기반, 복잡한 API, 낮은 성능",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "AIO": "AIO",
        "API": "API",
        "POSIX": "POSIX",
        "pool": "풀"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322063Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`epoll` + non-blocking: two syscalls per operation (one to check, one to act), no batching",
      "source_hash": 10370234763195723819,
      "context_hash": 2834542925576323973,
      "translation": "`epoll` + 논블로킹: 연산당 시스템 콜 두 번(확인에 한 번, 실행에 한 번), 배칭 없음",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "syscalls": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322063Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Linux `libaio`: low-level, incomplete operation coverage",
      "source_hash": 8262819889259315633,
      "context_hash": 14738734336387636927,
      "translation": "Linux `libaio`: 저수준, 불완전한 연산 지원 범위",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322063Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "io_uring's solution: **two lock-free rings in shared memory**.",
      "source_hash": 1265778413653242611,
      "context_hash": 1361950585244639611,
      "translation": "io_uring의 해법: **공유 메모리에 있는 두 개의 lock-free 링**입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "shared memory": "공유 메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322064Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "Userspace writes to the Submission Queue; the kernel posts results to the Completion Queue.",
      "source_hash": 1045274063460410615,
      "context_hash": 14060825530582723529,
      "translation": "사용자 공간은 제출 큐(Submission Queue)에 기록하고, 커널은 완료 큐(Completion Queue)에 결과를 게시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:34:22.305156Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:2",
      "source": "No per-operation syscall needed (especially with SQPOLL).",
      "source_hash": 7434771087300053861,
      "context_hash": 4852868806102619150,
      "translation": "연산마다 시스템 콜을 호출할 필요가 없습니다(특히 SQPOLL을 사용할 때).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SQPOLL": "SQPOLL",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322064Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "io_uring_setup",
      "source_hash": 12885217193229470263,
      "context_hash": 15957057273173399736,
      "translation": "io_uring_setup",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322064Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "After `io_uring_setup`, userspace maps two (or one, if `IORING_FEAT_SINGLE_MMAP`) memory regions:",
      "source_hash": 7547563763592256056,
      "context_hash": 473245908047139563,
      "translation": "`io_uring_setup` 이후 사용자 공간은 두 개(`IORING_FEAT_SINGLE_MMAP`인 경우 한 개)의 메모리 영역을 매핑합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "memory": "메모리",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322065Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Ring layout",
      "source_hash": 4513539925433893893,
      "context_hash": 3428844123416995423,
      "translation": "링 레이아웃",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322065Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct io_uring_sqe",
      "source_hash": 1847372942357709079,
      "context_hash": 5238566774395554664,
      "translation": "struct io_uring_sqe",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322065Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The Submission Queue Entry describes one I/O operation:",
      "source_hash": 4475692926763460344,
      "context_hash": 3752378457235856015,
      "translation": "제출 큐 엔트리(Submission Queue Entry)는 하나의 I/O 연산을 기술합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:34:22.305157Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct io_uring_cqe",
      "source_hash": 10847001355091364207,
      "context_hash": 14507567122358521612,
      "translation": "struct io_uring_cqe",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322065Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The Completion Queue Entry carries the result:",
      "source_hash": 1738370749726411854,
      "context_hash": 10583321206394279243,
      "translation": "완료 큐 엔트리(Completion Queue Entry)는 결과를 담습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:34:22.305157Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`res` semantics mirror the corresponding blocking syscall:",
      "source_hash": 9928717626884991076,
      "context_hash": 8260866290637528507,
      "translation": "`res`의 의미는 대응하는 블로킹 시스템 콜과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322065Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`IORING_OP_READ`: bytes read, or -errno",
      "source_hash": 4535799762719429663,
      "context_hash": 4579909697167630771,
      "translation": "`IORING_OP_READ`: 읽은 바이트 수 또는 -errno",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bytes": "바이트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322065Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`IORING_OP_WRITE`: bytes written, or -errno",
      "source_hash": 6566598095646895345,
      "context_hash": 9585518198801768520,
      "translation": "`IORING_OP_WRITE`: 쓴 바이트 수 또는 -errno",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bytes": "바이트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322065Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:6/seg:0",
