    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "io_uring_enter: the syscall",
      "source_hash": 12043213958989487739,
      "context_hash": 7499795977218512258,
      "translation": "io_uring_enter: 시스템 콜",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322066Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "With batching, a single `io_uring_enter` can submit many operations and wait for many completions.",
      "source_hash": 16276992240278042473,
      "context_hash": 2607935286900638493,
      "translation": "배칭을 사용하면 한 번의 `io_uring_enter`로 많은 연산을 제출하고 많은 완료를 기다릴 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322066Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "This amortizes the syscall overhead across all concurrent I/O.",
      "source_hash": 81562538602234749,
      "context_hash": 3933376476973038632,
      "translation": "이렇게 하면 시스템 콜 오버헤드가 동시에 진행되는 모든 I/O에 분산됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "overhead": "오버헤드",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:43:49.322066Z",
      "issues": []
    },
